  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb"/>I<chord name="Eb"/>vow to <chord name="Ab"/>thee, my <chord name="Bb"/>country, all <chord name="Eb"/>earthly things <chord name="F"/>a<chord name="Gm"/>bove,<br/>
      <chord name="Dm"/>En<chord name="Eb"/>tire and <chord name="Ab"/>whole and <chord name="Bb"/>perfect, the <chord name="Eb"/>service of my <chord name="Bb"/>love;<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>The <chord name="F"/>love that <chord name="Gm"/>asks the <chord name="F"/>reason, <chord name="Bb"/>the <chord name="F"/>love that <chord name="Bb"/>stands the <chord name="Eb"/>test,<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/>That <chord name="Gm"/>lays up<chord name="Bb"/>on <chord name="Eb"/>the <chord name="Bb"/>al<chord name="Cm"/>tar <chord name="Bb"/>the <chord name="Eb"/>dearest <chord name="Cm"/>and <chord name="Gm"/>the <chord name="F"/>be<chord name="Gm"/>st;<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>The <chord name="Eb"/>love that <chord name="Cm"/>never <chord name="Bb"/>falters, <chord name="Dm"/>the <chord name="Eb"/>love that pays <chord name="F"/>the <chord name="Gm"/>price,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>The <chord name="Eb"/>love that <chord name="Ab"/>makes <chord name="Bb"/>undaunted the <chord name="Eb"/>final sacri<chord name="Bb"/>fice.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb"/>And <chord name="Eb"/>there&#x27;s <chord name="Ab"/>another <chord name="Bb"/>country, I&#x27;ve <chord name="Eb"/>heard <chord name="F"/>of <chord name="Gm"/>long ago,<br/>
      <chord name="Dm"/>Most dear <chord name="Eb"/>to them <chord name="Ab"/>that love <chord name="Bb"/>her, most <chord name="Eb"/>great to <chord name="Bb"/>them that know;<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>We <chord name="F"/>may not <chord name="Gm"/>count <chord name="F"/>her armies, <chord name="Bb"/>we <chord name="F"/>may not <chord name="Bb"/>see <chord name="Eb"/>her King;<br/>
      <chord name="Cm"/><chord name="Gm"/>Her <chord name="Bb"/>fortress <chord name="Eb"/>is <chord name="Bb"/>a <chord name="Cm"/>faithful <chord name="Bb"/><chord name="Eb"/>heart, <chord name="Cm"/>her <chord name="Gm"/>pride <chord name="F"/>is <chord name="Gm"/>suffering;<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>And <chord name="Eb"/>one <chord name="Cm"/>by one <chord name="Bb"/>and <chord name="Dm"/>fervently <chord name="Eb"/>we pray <chord name="F"/>for <chord name="Gm"/>her increase,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>And her <chord name="Eb"/>ways are <chord name="Ab"/>ways of <chord name="Bb"/>gentleness, and <chord name="Eb"/>all her <chord name="Bb"/>paths are peace.
      </lines>
    </verse>
